SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Bangor Federal Court Closed to the Public- Mo
 nday\, October 5\, 2026.
DESCRIPTION:Wednesday\, September 30\, 2026\nDue to scheduled work being p
 erformed by the Bangor Water District\, the Margaret Chase Smith Federal B
 uilding\, including the U.S. District Court in Bangor\, will be closed to 
 the public on Monday\, October 5\, 2026.\nCourt staff will be working remo
 tely and will remain available to handle routine filings and telephone inq
 uiries.\nThe Court expects to resume normal operations on Tuesday\, Octobe
 r 6\, 2026.\nhttps://www.med.uscourts.gov/news/bangor-federal-court-closed
 -public-monday-october-5-2026
URL:https://www.med.uscourts.gov/news/bangor-federal-court-closed-public-m
 onday-october-5-2026
